"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"7\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-4\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Extra Space Seats<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"6\" aria-setsize=\"7\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-5\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Preferential &amp; Twin Seats<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"7\" aria-setsize=\"7\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-6\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Free Standard Seats<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-26 mat-tab-body-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-26 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><h2>Seats+</h2>\n<h3>Seat + &amp; Neighbour Seat Selection Service:</h3>\n<p>“Saudia” offers the advantage of \"Seat+ &amp; Neighbour seat Service\", which allows you to purchase additional space for one or more seats next to yours, subject to availability in the economy class, on both domestic and international flights operated by Saudia. This service aims to provide: </p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Extra comfort. </li>\n   <li>More personal space. </li>\n<li>Maintaining social distancing.</li> \n<li>This service can be requested at any time from 48 hours up to 3 hours before the departure time. </li>\n<li>All confirmed economy class tickets holders (except Saver tickets) can request this service through the booking management page &amp; SAUDIA mobile Application; except for: \n<ul>\n<li>Unaccompanied minors. </li>\n<li>Group bookings. </li>\n</ul>\n</li><li>Passengers can purchase a maximum of (3) seats per flight, subject to aircraft type and availability of adjacent seats. </li>\n<li>Payment for this service can be made using all approved payment methods by “Saudia”, with a valid economy class ticket; changes or refunds are not permitted after the purchasing process is accepted &amp; completed. It is valid only for the specific time / date / flight in the booking reference. </li>\n<li>A confirmation email and an official receipt (voucher) will be sent after booking. Please keep the confirmation as a reference for the service reservation. </li>\n<li>The service does not include any additional benefits, including but not limited to \"additional baggage allowance, or extra miles,\" or any other special service onboard the aircraft. </li>\n<li>The service is not available for seats located in the emergency exit row. </li>\n<li>In the event of no-show or request for any new seating or bidding upgrade service, the current seat voucher will lose its value. </li>\n<li>While priority is given to the neighbour seat, “Saudia” cannot guarantee that adjacent seats will not be occupied by other passengers as these seats are subject to booking by other guests and are available until the last moment. </li>\n<li>“Saudia\" reserves the right to change seats before or after boarding for safety reasons. Guests who do not comply with approved safety instructions will be requested to change their seat and will lose their eligibility for the refund. </li>\n<li>In case of circumstances beyond Saudia’s control or any unforeseen flight disruptions, “Saudia” will take all necessary measures to accommodate all guest requests by providing an alternative seat with the same benefits. However, it may not necessarily be the same seat number previously chosen on the seat map. Nevertheless, requests for involuntary changes or refunds will be allowed in case of flight delays or cancellations according to “Saudia”' policies or in case the service was not provided. </li>\n<li>Involuntary refunds will be made in the same currency and payment method as at purchase. </li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-27 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-1\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-27 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-28 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-2\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-28 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-29 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-3\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-30 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-4\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-31 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-5\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-5\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-32 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-6\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-6\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-32 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}